   "date": "2026-07-18",
   "title": "ニシタチ夜市2026｜見どころ・日程｜歩行者天国で楽しむ宮崎の夏イベント",
   "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18188\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi1.jpg 800w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi1-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table sp_block_\"><table><tbody style=\"--tbody-th-color--bg:var(--color_gray);--tbody-th-color--txt:var(--swl-text_color--black)\"><tr><th>開催期間</th><td>2026年7月18日(土)</td></tr><tr><th>時間</th><td>15：00～21：00</td></tr><tr><th>場所</th><td>ニシタチエリア、上野町エリア</td></tr><tr><th>Web情報</th><td><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nishitachi_yoichi/\">ニシタチ夜市Instagram</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/702352251_18144423136504222_8963069221335866153_n-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18171\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/702352251_18144423136504222_8963069221335866153_n-819x1024.jpg 819w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/702352251_18144423136504222_8963069221335866153_n-240x300.jpg 240w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/702352251_18144423136504222_8963069221335866153_n-768x960.jpg 768w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/702352251_18144423136504222_8963069221335866153_n-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/702352251_18144423136504222_8963069221335866153_n.jpg 1430w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nishitachi_yoichi/\">ニシタチ夜市Instagramより</a></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"819\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745842923_18150099550504222_1437377885156329768_n-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18170\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745842923_18150099550504222_1437377885156329768_n-819x1024.jpg 819w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745842923_18150099550504222_1437377885156329768_n-240x300.jpg 240w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745842923_18150099550504222_1437377885156329768_n-768x960.jpg 768w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745842923_18150099550504222_1437377885156329768_n-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/745842923_18150099550504222_1437377885156329768_n.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 819px) 100vw, 819px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nishitachi_yoichi/\">ニシタチ夜市Instagramより</a></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2019年に始まった「ニシタチ夜市」は、かつて昭和の商店街で親しまれていた夜祭りのようなにぎわいを取り戻そうと始まったイベントです。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">宮崎最大の飲食店街「ニシタチ」が歩行者天国となり、普段は店内営業の通り沿い店舗も路上に出店。いつもとはひと味違うにぎわいのなかで、食べ歩きや街歩きを楽しめます。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">気になるお店の味を気軽に楽しめる食べ歩き</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi6.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18187\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi6.jpg 800w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi6-300x200.jpg 300w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi6-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><br>昭和２９年創業『丸万焼鳥本店』</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">普段は店内で営業する通り沿いの店舗も路上に出店。気になっていたお店の味を気軽に楽しめるのも、ニシタチ夜市の魅力です。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">お店同士のつながりで、他店舗の人気メニューもあわせて販売するブースが登場することも。<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nishitachi_yoichi/\">公式Instagram</a>で出店情報を確認しておくと、気になるお店やグルメを見逃さずに楽しめます。</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">同時開催｜小戸神社の夏越祭</h2>\n\n\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KYa46SetPXI?si=1tjG8sHsGOeIJRqF\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2026年のポスターでは「同時開催」として小戸神社の夏越祭も案内されていました。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi7.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18189\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi7.png 800w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi7-300x200.png 300w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi7-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">小戸神社の夏越祭は毎年7月25日・26日に近い土日に開催され、小戸神社を午後1時に出発し、午後8時ごろに上野町（かつての鎮座地）へ到着します。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2026年は宮崎八幡宮の夏越祭も同日に開催されていて、市街地ではそれぞれ異なる神輿行列や祭りの雰囲気を楽しめる週末となりました。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi3.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18190\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi3.jpg 800w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi3-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18191\" srcset=\"https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi2.jpg 800w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://arunova.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/nishitachi-yoichi2-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">さまざまな場所で盛り上がるパフォーマンス</h2>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DaN_464J5FB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DaN_464J5FB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> <div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\"> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;\"></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 60px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"padding: 19% 0;\"></div> <div style=\"display:block; height:50px; margin:0 auto 12px; width:50px;\"><svg width=\"50px\" height=\"50px\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"https://www.